        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "path_time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Myriad Year Flying Warship has four main killer moves: torrential charge, daybreak sword, daybreak torrent, and myriad year hunting, each rank eight. Outside the River of Time, without that environment’s amplification, the warship’s killer moves only show normal strength, yet Fang Yuan still uses daybreak swords as probing attacks with deep intent against a Western Desert formation.",
      "chapters": [
        1872
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "warship-kit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_western_desert"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A later cast where the rank eight move nearly fails to land lasting harm.",
      "chapters": [],
